## 🔗 Integration Points

**Reads from:**
- `$PROJECTS_ROOT/` - All projects
- `$PROJECTS_ROOT/project-scaffolding/EXTERNAL_RESOURCES.md` - Resource tracking
- Individual project `README.md`, `TODO.md`, `00_Index_*.md` files

**Project Index Validation:**
- Uses `project-scaffolding/scripts/validate_project.py`
- Checks for `00_Index_[ProjectName].md` in each project
- Surface indexing status on dashboard

